    pearls: "A PEF <33% of predicted indicates life-threatening asthma. Silent chest (no wheeze) is a sign of severe obstruction and impending respiratory arrest. IV magnesium is second-line but effective in severe exacerbations. Always prescribe an spacer with MDI — it doubles lung deposition.",
