    pharm: "1. Oxygen via Venturi mask 24-28% to target SpO2 88-92% (caution: CO2 retention). 2. Nebulised Salbutamol 5mg + Ipratropium 0.5mg 4-hourly. 3. IV Hydrocortisone 200mg stat then oral Prednisolone 30mg daily for 5-7 days. 4. Antibiotics: Amoxicillin/Clavulanate 625mg PO TID for 7 days (or Doxycycline 100mg BID if penicillin-allergic). 5. Consider NIV if pH <7.35 and pCO2 >45 despite medical therapy.",
