    monitoring: "ABGs daily or as clinically indicated. SpO2 continuously. Sputum colour and volume. Temperature. Monitor for CO2 retention (headache, confusion, flapping tremor).",
    counselling: "Emphasise smoking cessation as the single most important intervention. Demonstrate correct inhaler technique. Teach sputum clearing techniques (huff cough). Explain signs of worsening to watch for. Importance of pulmonary rehabilitation.",
