    pharm: "1. First-line antibiotics per Kenya CAP guidelines: Oral Amoxicillin 1g TID for 7 days (mild-moderate). 2. If hospitalised for IV therapy: IV Ampicillin 2g QID + Doxycycline 200mg stat then 100mg BID (or Azithromycin 500mg IV daily). 3. Alternative: IV Ceftriaxone 1g daily if concern for Gram-negative coverage. 4. Paracetamol 1g QID for fever and pleuritic pain. 5. Monitor for clinical response at 48-72 hours.",
