    labs: "WBC 13.5 x10^9/L (neutrophilia). CRP 95 mg/L. Sputum culture: Heavy growth of Pseudomonas aeruginosa (mucoid phenotype). Hb 11.0 g/dL. ABG: pH 7.38, pCO2 45, pO2 72 on RA. HIV: negative.",
